      "date": "2026-07-27 21:12:54.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 3:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nExperimental feature testing in progress, please pay attention to the comments\n\nThe include swap itself looks correct - nothing in gnilnd_proc.c uses a symbol declared by lprocfs_status.h, and the only thing it was pulling in transitively was <linux/proc_fs.h>. One comment on the commit message inline. Worth noting that gnilnd only builds with --enable-gni plus the Cray GNI kernel headers (config/lustre-lnet.m4 defaults enable_gni=no), so the Jenkins Verified+1 never compiled this file; a gni-enabled build is the only real confirmation.",
